==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*The enemy base here is a [[Goal Plate Base (Enemy Base)|Goal Plate Base]].
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 18.67 seconds<sup>560f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Tails (Enemy)|Tails]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

